{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":1410105,"duration_api_ms":1463430,"num_turns":65,"result":"Now let me produce the final ExecutionPayload JSON response:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"execution_payload/v1\",\n  \"task_id\": \"tanksim-6e5.4.6\",\n  \"result\": \"complete\",\n  \"plan\": {\n    \"summary\": \"Add 5 carbonate regression probes as e2e tests in tank_harness, plus a summary report test. Extend the Envelope struct with KH and DIC bounds for carbonate-specific assertions. Each probe isolates one carbonate chemistry pathway (source-water equilibrium, aeration CO2 stripping, day/night photosynthesis swing, water-change alkalinity delivery, nitrification-driven buffering contrast).\",\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"Extend Envelope in tank_harness/src/lib.rs with kh_d_bounds and dic_mg_c_per_l_bounds fields, builder methods, and check logic\",\n      \"Create e2e_carbonate_probes.rs with helper functions (carbonate_diag, dump_trace_artifact, load_source_profile, equilibrium_tank, nitrifying_tank, light_transition_hours)\",\n      \"Implement Probe 1: source-water pH differentiation (hard_shrimp vs ro_like, gap > 1.0)\",\n      \"Implement Probe 2: aeration-driven CO2 stripping (aerated vs passive, pH diff > 0.1)\",\n      \"Implement Probe 3: day/night pH drift (planted tank, light pH > dark pH)\",\n      \"Implement Probe 4: water change pH effect (RO -> hard water, positive pH shift)\",\n      \"Implement Probe 5: nitrification-driven pH decline (soft KH2 decline > 0.5, hard KH8 decline < 0.35, soft > hard)\",\n      \"Implement all_carbonate_probes_summary test that runs all 5 and prints report\",\n      \"Verify all tests pass, clippy clean, fmt clean\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"files_changed\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_harness/src/lib.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modified\",\n      \"description\": \"Added kh_d_bounds and dic_mg_c_per_l_bounds to Envelope struct with builder methods and check() logic for carbonate regression assertions\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crates/tank_harness/tests/e2e_carbonate_probes.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"created\",\n      \"description\": \"848-line e2e test file with 5 carbonate scenario probes and 1 summary report test. Includes debug trace artifact dumping, carbonate state diagnostics, and documented tolerance ranges with scientific justifications.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"test_results\": {\n    \"command\": \"cargo test --test e2e_carbonate_probes\",\n    \"passed\": 6,\n    \"failed\": 0,\n    \"tests\": [\n      \"probe_1_source_water_ph_differentiation\",\n      \"probe_2_aeration_driven_co2_stripping\",\n      \"probe_3_day_night_ph_drift\",\n      \"probe_4_water_change_ph_effect\",\n      \"probe_5_nitrification_driven_ph_decline\",\n      \"all_carbonate_probes_summary\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"quality_checks\": {\n    \"clippy\": \"pass (no new warnings)\",\n    \"fmt\": \"pass\"\n  },\n  \"observed_probe_values\": {\n    \"probe_1\": \"hard_shrimp pH=8.297, ro_like pH=6.732, gap=1.565 (threshold >1.0)\",\n    \"probe_2\": \"aerated pH=8.488, passive pH=8.183, diff=0.305 (threshold >0.1)\",\n    \"probe_3\": \"light_max_pH=7.412, dark_min_pH=7.308, swing=0.103 (threshold >0.0)\",\n    \"probe_4\": \"before pH=6.303, after 50% hard WC pH=7.504, shift=+1.201 (threshold >0.0)\",\n    \"probe_5\": \"soft KH2: pH 7.301->6.560 decline=0.742 (threshold >0.5) | hard KH8: pH 7.301->7.030 decline=0.271 (threshold <0.35)\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Probe 5 required matching starting pH between soft and hard tanks by tuning DIC to alkalinity ratio (DIC = Alk_meq × 13.35) targeting pH ~7.3 for both. Without this, pH-dependent nitrification inhibition at low pH in soft water caused hard water to decline MORE than soft — inverting the buffering story.\",\n    \"Filter disabled in Probe 5 to eliminate gas exchange (filter_kla_boost). Nitrifier biomass set to 10x normal (AOB 2.5g, NOB 1.5g, comammox 0.5g) to compensate for filter_enabled_factor=0.